# Rest in Peace replaces every card going to a graveyard with exile (CR 614.1a), so nothing is ever "put into a graveyard"
# and the Void never triggers: after Lightning Bolt resolves the stack is empty. (Without Rest in Peace the Bolt's trigger
# would be on the stack there; planar-void-exiles-a-spell-from-the-stack-whoever-cast-it is that control.) The Bolt is
# exiled by the replacement.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Planar Void
Rest in Peace
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

